(A) The left endpoint Riemann sum is 
<m>f(2) \cdot 0.5 + f(2.5) \cdot 0.5 + \cdots + f(5.5) \cdot 0.5
= ( 0.363636363636364 + 0.568181818181818 + \cdots + 2.75 ) \cdot 0.5 = 5.59091.</m>







